WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.580
Does the evil in the world leave

2
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.600
you feeling helpless?

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.540
Near the end of Romans,

4
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.060
Paul gives a troubled church a promise:

5
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.880
the God of peace will crush Satan

6
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:13.780
under their feet.

7
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.020
God’s peace includes the defeat of evil.

8
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.440
Satan is no rival sovereign,

9
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.340
and fear doesn’t have to rule

10
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:21.840
the church.

11
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.140
Paul calls believers to hold

12
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.460
to the truth they’ve been taught,

13
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.460
to be wise about what’s good

14
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.160
and innocent about evil.

15
00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.040
You don’t need to keep feeding

16
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:31.640
your fears.

17
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.460
Return to the gospel.

18
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:34.980
Choose what’s good,

19
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.360
alongside the people God has given you.

20
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:38.940
We still face trouble,

21
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.240
but evil won’t have the last word.

22
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.180
The God of peace will.
